{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "english", "appid": 553850, "month": "2024-07", "window": 3, "start_date": 1721088000, "end_date": 1721779199, "month_true_total": 5178, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:15:28 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "170590597", "author": {"steamid": "76561198121033639", "personaname": "Rivendor", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198121033639/", "num_games_owned": 215, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 2128, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1914, "last_played": 1767310183, "avatar": "6330c0531c83e7262767b52a29728f6801bcc289"}, "language": "english", "review": "First off it's a good game BUT needs balances badly. \nThe jump in difficulty from bugs to automatons is ridiculous and not even fun ( seriously nobody wants to do them because the rewards are the same). \nAutos basically you just throw down sentries and keep calling in stuff and pray / hope you make it while dying over and over. \nAlso weapons...there should be no reason why EVERYONE has to have incidenary breakers but yet no other weapon comes close. The other weapons need a boost badly since everything feels like it's pointless besides that one weapon. \nKicking...I see they are addressing that with next update but people can kick anytime for any reason with no punishment and if you are kicked no rewards. \nJust came back to change my review from recommend to not because of kicking. Spent last 30 minutes in a match carrying the team just to get kicked as defending extraction. \nNeeds to be a penalty for kicking...a vote...or shocker remove it altogether unless someone is AFK. \nWas fun but going to take a break from it because its not worth the time for no reward and all the above mentioned issues.", "timestamp_created": 1721778620, "timestamp_updated": 1721785002, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_coun